1
00:00:05,352 --> 00:00:07,092
(Sheldon:)Come on, take me
to work with you.

2
00:00:07,254 --> 00:00:09,094
(Leonard:)No. You're on vacation.

3
00:00:09,256 --> 00:00:11,736
Please? What if there's a big
breakthrough in science today

4
00:00:11,892 --> 00:00:13,062
(Sheldon:)and I'm not there to see it?

5
00:00:13,226 --> 00:00:14,496
(Leonard:)Do you really think
there's gonna be a breakthrough

6
00:00:14,661 --> 00:00:18,041
(Leonard:)-without you there to do it?
-No. I was just tricking you.

7
00:00:19,332 --> 00:00:20,782
(Leonard:)Bye.

8
00:00:22,702 --> 00:00:24,112
Leonard, wait!

9
00:00:24,271 --> 00:00:26,251
(Sheldon:)-Take me with you.
-No!

10
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,450
(Sheldon:)-Please.
-No!

11
00:00:28,608 --> 00:00:30,608
(Sheldon:)-Too bad. I'm coming with you.
-Sheldon, stay!

12
00:00:30,777 --> 00:00:32,587
(Sheldon:)-But--
-I said stay!

13
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,790
(Leonard:)I'm going to work.

14
00:00:41,955 --> 00:01:02,025
(Leonard:)Do not follow me.

